1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Hello, what are the main financial
and operational risks in agriculture?

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Such as droughts, lack of irrigation,
or crop failure, that small farmers face?

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Main problems are legal framework,
because Moldova has started

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:22,000
30 years ago a land reform
which is not finished.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,000
So many farmers are not secure
what fields they can use.

6
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:33,000
First, there is also a main obstacle
for investors, by the way.

7
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:38,000
And the second problem, especially
for small farmers:

8
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:44,000
a lack of professional education
and also a lack of financial literacy.

9
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Have there been cases in your practice
when financial support

10
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:55,000
or loans to agriculture enterprises
did not pay off?

11
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Or issues arose with repayment
because farmers mismanaged their budgets?

12
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Yes, of course,
it is a logical effect.

13
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:12,000
If you lack professional know-how
and knowledge,

14
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:17,000
then you do the wrong things.
You apply the wrong fertilizers,

15
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:22,000
the wrong machinery.
So this happens quite often.

16
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:28,000
We are developing a platform where
artificial intelligence will process data

17
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:33,000
from field sensors and predict
irrigation needs

18
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:38,000
based on real weather conditions.
How much would such precision help

19
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:43,000
financial organizations and investors
reduce crop failure risks?

20
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Such a tool can help farmers
and is also very interesting

21
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:55,000
for banks and insurance companies,
because the big complaint

22
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:00,000
of banks and financial institutions
is that farmers are not "bankable".

23
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:06,000
That means they do not provide
enough information to the banks

24
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:11,000
which refer directly to their
operational business and results.

25
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:17,000
With the help of such a tool,
they would be able to provide

26
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:22,000
better information about it.

27
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:27,000
And another problem is the insurance,
because only a small part

28
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:32,000
of the small farmers are insured.
That means if there is any hailstorm,

29
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:37,000
they often have a huge loss.

30
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:43,000
With data from sensors,
a farmer could prove the weather conditions

31
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:48,000
and prove his demands
to insurance companies.

32
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:54,000
On our platform, farmers will be able
to find educational video tutorials

33
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:59,000
from university professors
on financial planning.

34
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:04,000
How in-demand is financial literacy
education among small farmers in Moldova?

35
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:09,000
Would this help improve
their creditworthiness?

36
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:15,000
Professional know-how and
financial literacy is really needed,

37
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:20,000
and farmers like to get know-how
about these topics.

38
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:26,000
Our platform plans to feature
a separate information block

39
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:31,000
with real testing results
of technologies on pilot farms.

40
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:36,000
How much will this help
financial structures and investors

41
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:41,000
direct funds only
toward proven solutions?

42
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:47,000
Well, to spread best practices
is always good,

43
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:52,000
but it would be not enough
just to present the best results.

44
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:57,000
You should also present the way
how you can achieve these good results.

45
00:03:57,000 --> 00:04:03,000
The target group for this
I see mainly in local farmers,

46
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:08,000
not that much in investors,
because the investors usually

47
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:13,000
do not need that much tips
like the local farmers.

48
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:16,000
Okay, thank you so much.
